fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"decklink/decklinkvideosink.html#decklinkvideosink:output-vanc","fragment":"\n\toutput-vanc\n\nOutput GstAncillaryMeta from input buffers as part of the ancillary data\nof the video frames.\nNote that currently the horizontal offset is not preserved.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});